   quarter, not 3 columns filling the full width). Column 1
   (.drawer-menu__primary-links) stops translating away and gets a fixed
   1/4 width; columns 2 and 3 need NO new left/width rules of their own —
   .drawer-menu__item has no `position` set (see its rule above), so
   .drawer-menu__list--sub's existing `left:100%; width:100%` already
