   stay on top of the whole panel including column 3's image, same as
   before. Raising the panel this way would normally also lift .drawer-
   menu__bottom's white background above the bar (reintroducing the
   flat white strip this whole z-index approach was meant to avoid) —
   see its own background rule for how that's specifically avoided. */
