}
/* Column 1's text (categories + promo carousel, both already inside this
   wrapper — see drawer-menu.liquid) reads as arriving just after the
   panel itself, not simultaneously with it: same .visible toggle as the
   panel above, just a shorter fade+translate with its own delay so it
   starts partway through the panel's slide instead of racing it. */
