   Category bar, 54px: the parent category (setting "Titulo de la barra") 14px medium capitals 16px from the edge, 40px
   before the categories; categories 12px / 16px regular black 32px apart, the current one bold with its product count
   raised beside it. */
html body .collection-sticky-bar .custom-subnav-bar{
